ightlife","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"Sr2BcS8nRAqW4gTbjDNBKg","review_id":"NKGbNPerRfz1sO1FBNmUZg","date":"2017-04-28T02:19:06","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9347835779190063,"text_excerpt":"Great energy and yummy cocktails on opening night! Tonight NOLA Distilling opened it's doors and really delivered. It was a great evening with amazing energy and lots of people. Currently, they are serving vodka mixed drinks, daiquiris, and jello shots. I haven't had vodka in a loooong time (reminds me too much of undergrad), but their drinks were actually very yummy! I tried a few of my friends' drinks before settling on the Aguas Picantes, very refreshing and not too sweet. We also had the daiquiri, citrus blast, and shrub. They were all good, but my favorite was the Aguas Picantes for sure. The daiquiri definitely had a kick, pretty tart. And the shrub was unoffensive, but too complex ..."},{"business_id":"Sr2BcS8nRAqW4gTbjDNBKg","review_id":"G_mMa9OeWoJtqNercL8aYA","date":"2018-01-14T03:25:52","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9299203157424927,"text_excerpt":"NOLA Distilling is a hidden gem among all of the Tchoupitoulas breweries. We stopped by to meet my sister and her friends after going to two other breweries on the street. When we arrived, we were the only ones there on a Saturday. We had some unique cocktails, but they were SO delicious. I had a \"hold the milk punch\" and my fiance had an \"aviation\" which had violet liqueur! I can't tell you the names of what everyone else ordered (we all ordered something different), but every sip that I had was AMAZING! We hung out for a good bit at the distillery catching up with one another, befriending the awesome bartender, and stealing sips of each others drinks. Before we left, the bartender gave ..."},{"business_id":"Sr2BcS8nRAqW4gTbjDNBKg","review_id":"qlXgeDpurxt7etP9u3QzAA","date":"2019-11-23T18:54:58","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9289237260818481,"text_excerpt":"Got the distillery tour on a Groupon and it was worth it. We got the tour and a shot. We wanted to get the one that included the bottle but because we only had carryon bags we passed it up. The bartender (dark hair lady with glasses) was cool as hell. She welcomed us and had plenty of conversation. She gave us some good places fo eat and some things to do while we were in the city. The tour was nice and informative. It was cool to learn about production of the spirits I enjoy. During the tour we got some samples of the spirits. Kyle, our guide, answered our groups questions and shared with us some of his experiments with infusing the flavors vodka. I have to come back next time to enjoy s..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"Sr2BcS8nRAqW4gTbjDNBKg","photo_id":"264Fyqgtev1fRUnTK3iQMg","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/264Fyqgtev1fRUnTK3iQMg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8822416067123413},{"business_id":"Sr2BcS8nRAqW4gTbjDNBKg","photo_id":"l9XGudek3gDr3KsluwNX6Q","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/l9XGudek3gDr3KsluwNX6Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8596327304840088},{"business_id":"Sr2BcS8nRAqW4gTbjDNBKg","photo_id":"o_updCg_AoVNavDH3C7e_Q","lab